From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nopjmp <kthompson@hey.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Dec 2021 16:29:14 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 045/179] Paper Backports

- Backport Dionysus server/0022-Paper-Backports.patch
- Source: https://github.com/nopjmp/Dionysus at b5c71b62f6f1f555b22bd52f5751e33be4690b6e
- EntityLiving: add getItemInHand(EnumHand) obfhelper
- EnumDirection: cache adjX, adjY, adjZ in direction enum and modernize predicates
- MinecraftServer: add waitForAsyncTasksShutdown and optimize time updates per world
- NBTTagCompound: reduce memory footprint using fastutil Object2ObjectOpenHashMap
- PlayerConnection: refresh and validate held item before interacting
- World: avoid tile entity map lookup when capturedTileEntities is empty
- CraftServer: implement waitForAsyncTasksShutdown to warn overdue workers
- Main: cap jdk.nio.maxCachedBufferSize to 256KB to avoid direct buffer leaks

